export anchor SignPainterStyle:
    number: 153
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Sign painter
    idea: The dashboard is a hand-painted shop front, with a green fascia in gold-leaf letters, the greeting arched across the window, the totals on painted show cards and the projects listed on a lettered directory board.
    base: light
    palette:
        wall: #f5efe1, the page around the shop front
        windowGlass: #fbf8f0, the window, fields and search
        fasciaGreen: #1f3d2b, the fascia, window frame, last week bars and progress stripes
        goldLeaf: #c9962e, drop shadows, pinstripes and card shadows, never small text
        paleGold: #e9c96e, gold lettering and lines on green, the greeting outline and the focus halo
        oxblood: #6e1d17, the greeting, script accents, the primary button, overdue, Behind, this week bars and focus
        signBlack: #1c1a17, block lettering, outlines and dotted leaders
        muted: #5a5246, meta and day labels
        showCard: #fffaf0, show cards and boards
        okGreen: #2d5a2a, On track
        riskAmber: #7a5100, At risk
        rule: #d8c9a8, hairlines between directory lines
    type:
        Block lettering uses Rockwell, Rockwell Nova, Roboto Slab,
        Clarendon, Superclarendon, Georgia, serif in bold caps. Script
        accents use Brush Script MT, Segoe Script, Apple Chancery, URW
        Chancery L, cursive at 19 to 30px and never carry a fact alone.
        Body uses Georgia, Times New Roman, serif. Fascia brand 44px in
        pale gold with a gold and black drop, the window greeting 58px
        caps set on an arc, show card figures 64px with a pale gold drop,
        directory names 18px caps, body 15 to 16px.
    layout:
        A shop front up to 1240px. The fascia is a green board with a
        double gold pinstripe inset, the brand in gilt letters with a
        script line under it, caps nav in cream with a pale gold
        underline on Home, a cream search, an oxblood button with a gold
        inner line and black drop, a gold ring bell and a gold avatar. The
        window below has a 12px green frame, a gold inner line and two
        faint diagonal glare streaks. GOOD MORNING, MARA is painted in
        oxblood caps with a gold shade along an arc, the date sits under
        it in script, and 4 TASKS ARE OVERDUE sits between double rules.
        Four show cards, each slightly tilted, have a script eyebrow such
        as Now showing, a large figure, a rule and the caps label, with a
        hard gold shadow. Below, a directory board lists each project as
        a caps name, dotted leaders and a large percent, then the
        category in script, a pinstriped progress bar, tasks, due date and
        status. A side column holds two smaller boards, Tasks done with
        green then oxblood bars carrying gold shade and a pale gold inner
        line, and Lately, the activity with times in script. On phones
        cards go two by two and boards stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24 to 32px between cards and boards, 12px between directory lines.
    density: Medium. Big showy lettering up top and a tidy directory below.
    corners: Square cards and boards, 3 to 6px on the fascia, buttons and fields, round bell and avatar.
    borders: Gold pinstripes inset in the fascia, the window frame and every board, 2px black around show cards, dotted leaders and double rules.
    shadows: Hard offset drops only, gold under black letters and cards and black under the primary button, like painted shade lines.
    icons:
        Solid painted shapes. Status uses a ticked circle for On track, a
        triangle with an exclamation for At risk and a crossed square for
        Behind, beside the caps word.
    focus: A 3px oxblood outline offset 2 to 3px inside a 6 to 8px pale gold halo, a pale gold outline on the green fascia.
    tone: A friendly shopkeeper, such as Now showing, the full directory and news from the workshop.
